    "input_texts": [
      "Title: ServiceNow Change Request List Filtering Workflow\nDescription: Step-by-step procedure to open the filter panel and add sequential AND conditions for Change Request records.\n- Navigate to the Change Request list page (URL ending in change_request_list.do) to begin filtering.\n- Click the 'Show / hide filter' button (bid a47) to reveal the filter input panel.\n- Click the first field chooser combobox (bid a1181) and select the 'Type' field.\n- Select the 'Normal' option for the 'Type' field value using the value chooser (bid a1639).\n- Click the 'Add AND Condition To Condition 1' button (bid a1303) to append the next condition.\n- Select the 'Requested by' field from the new condition's field chooser (bid a1659).\n- Enter 'System Administrator' into the 'Requested by' textbox (bid a2118).\n- Click the 'Add AND Condition To Condition 2' button (bid a1781) to continue building the filter chain.\n- Select the 'Model' field from the new condition's field chooser (bid a2135).\n- Set the operator for 'Model' to 'is empty string' (bid a2579) to match empty values.\n- Click the 'Add AND Condition To Condition 3' button (bid a2257) to prepare for the final conditions."
    ],
